If you still won’t provide even that, can you state plainly whether you’re refusing (a) any deterministic mapping at all, or (b) only deterministic mappings that you think could be repurposed into a stopping mechanism? The boundary itself is becoming the object of iteration for me, and I need a clean definition to prevent that.
